  "description": "Native AOT and trim compatible publish/subscribe on RabbitMQ.Client 7. Subscribers are plain handler classes resolved per message from a DI scope; publishers are typed per message. A source generator infers each handler's message type. JSON uses source-generated contracts, falling back to reflection only where reflection is enabled.",
